    "description": "A 3D animated scene featuring a customizeable Kirby. You can freely change his animation/pose, color scheme, facial expression, hat, weapon, the stage he stands on, and other details. Also try clicking on Kirby for a little greeting. \nYou can adjust the music and camera settings to your liking. When using Free Camera mode, you can rotate the camera by clicking and dragging across your desktop.\n\nThis wallpaper mostly takes inspiration from Kirby Air Ride and similar appearances of Kirby during this era, but there are references from across the entire series present.\n\nA very special thanks to Gariam who's Layer Parenting and 3D Camera scripts helped to make this wallpaper possible.\n\nResource rippers:\nPloaj | Centrixe the Dodo | Joker496 | Test | Link101 | thegameexplorer | DinnerSonic | Peardian | lemurboy12 | MLSpence3D | Goronic | Starwaffle | Shadowth117 | Brewster T. Koopa | PPGUndertale101\n\nSource games:\nKirby Air Ride | Super Smash Bros. Brawl | Kirby's Return to Dream Land | Kirby and the Forgotten Land | WarioWare: Touched! | Metroid Prime | Nickelodeon Party Blast | Super Mario Galaxy | Team Kirby Clash Deluxe | Kirby's Blowout Blast | Kirby: Planet Robobot | Kirby Star Allies",
